$\n\n \n\nThe auxiliary equation has pure imaginary roots:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+11 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2} & =-11 \\\\ \\lambda  & =\\pm \\sqrt{11}\\,\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{11}x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{11}x).\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14064047/state.json" "file_sha256" "3f2c955db89ff2206ed531f593a149661417e293b1cffba8bae7ce025cdce38d"} {"question" "q-130153" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14064047/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0482831521116e3467a76cdb107108638d7d5531b5dd69b53e1c1b2caa227465"} {"question" "q-130153" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14064047/state.json" "file_sha256" "3f2c955db89ff2206ed531f593a149661417e293b1cffba8bae7ce025cdce38d"} {"question" "q-130153" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11\\sqrt{11}x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(11\\sqrt{11}x)"] ["math" "y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(11x)"] ["math" "y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{11}x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{11}x)"] ["math" "y={e}^{x}(P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(11x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(11x))"] ["math" "y={e}^{x}(P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\sqrt{11}x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{11}x))"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14064047/state.json" "file_sha256" "3f2c955db89ff2206ed531f593a149661417e29